13:38.283 --> 13:40.751
The battery's dead.
It's gone.

13:40.819 --> 13:43.913
I gotta charge it up again.

13:43.988 --> 13:45.979
This one piece is makin'me nervous.

13:46.057 --> 13:48.048
- You seriously need to stop touching me.
- This right here.

13:48.126 --> 13:50.720
Please stop touching me.
This is really ridiculous.

13:50.795 --> 13:52.786
I'm stuffed in here like a jerk.

13:52.864 --> 13:55.059
- Deandra, you look sensational.
- No, I don't.

13:55.133 --> 13:58.398
Just remember. Let Daddy do all the talkin'.

13:58.470 --> 14:01.803
Sorry I'm late.

14:01.873 --> 14:04.000
- Jack Stanford.
- Frank Reynolds.

14:04.075 --> 14:06.305
- This here is my daughter, Deandra.
- Hi.

14:06.378 --> 14:08.107
Hi.

14:08.179 --> 14:10.340
Well, I never like to keep
a beautiful woman waiting.

14:10.415 --> 14:14.351
- Oh. Thanks.
- You see, uh, Mr. Stanford...

14:14.419 --> 14:17.183
I myself am a problem solver...

14:17.255 --> 14:19.587
and you got a big problem
on your hands.

14:19.657 --> 14:21.921
I'm afraid I'm not following.

14:21.993 --> 14:23.984
Check out the goods to my right.

14:24.062 --> 14:27.259
This pretty little lady
is not only my daughter.

14:27.332 --> 14:30.165
She happens to be your biggest opponent
in the election.

14:30.235 --> 14:32.362
Beauty and the beast.

14:32.437 --> 14:35.770
You're funny.

14:35.840 --> 14:38.775
Let the men do the work here, Dee.

14:38.843 --> 14:41.641
Now we can make
this problem go away...

14:41.713 --> 14:45.171
before it becomes a more
expensive problem...

14:45.250 --> 14:48.947
if you catch my... drift.

14:49.020 --> 14:53.514
Are you trying to solicit
a bribe from me?

14:53.591 --> 14:55.752
I don't know. Am I?

14:55.827 --> 14:57.818
'Cause if you are...

14:57.896 --> 15:01.423
not only is that illegal
and highly unethical...

15:01.499 --> 15:04.491
but you're doing it
with the subtlety of a baboon.

15:04.569 --> 15:06.867
- Let me take another approach here.
- I tell you what.

15:06.938 --> 15:11.034
- What...
- Why don't we discuss this over dinner?

15:11.109 --> 15:13.202
Dinner. That sounds good.

15:13.278 --> 15:16.270
- I was talking to her.
- Look, Jack...

15:16.347 --> 15:18.872
my little girl don't go nowhere
without her old man.

15:18.950 --> 15:21.942
- Isn't that right, sweetie?
- You're fired.

15:22.020 --> 15:24.352
Frank. Frankie, I gotta talk to you.

15:26.124 --> 15:28.524
- Not interested.
- Look, man, I'm in a lot of shit here.

15:28.593 --> 15:31.756
- So?
- I need to destroy Dennis.

15:33.598 --> 15:36.761
What do you have in mind?

15:36.835 --> 15:39.998
When Dennis Reynolds
was a counselor at Camp Cumberland...

15:40.071 --> 15:44.269
he was sent home for the statutory rape
of a teenage camper.

15:44.342 --> 15:47.971
A vote for Dennis Reynolds
is a vote for underage rape.

15:48.046 --> 15:50.412
Dennis Reynolds... baby rapist.

15:50.482 --> 15:53.383
Don't let him rape you, Philadelphia.

15:55.453 --> 15:58.422
- This is a goddamn smear campaign.
- You raped a girl?

15:58.490 --> 16:00.822
No, no. Okay. Rape?

16:02.193 --> 16:05.594
I was accused of...
Okay, statutory, first of all.

16:05.663 --> 16:08.860
Not... I kissed her.
She was a year younger than me.

16:08.933 --> 16:11.925
That's not... even statutory
or anything.

16:12.003 --> 16:14.369
What's the note say?

16:14.439 --> 16:16.566
All right. Yeah.
All right.

16:16.641 --> 16:18.609
Uh, "Meet"...

16:18.676 --> 16:21.474
Starts out "Meet,"
and then there's, like, other stuff.

16:23.348 --> 16:25.077
"Meet me in the parking garage.
Frank."

16:25.149 --> 16:27.447
- Yeah?
- Yeah.

16:27.519 --> 16:29.851
You clearly have
a learning disability, dude.

16:29.921 --> 16:32.253
- This is a trap.
- It's not a trap. Go see what he wants.

16:32.323 --> 16:34.689
- It's a trap.
- It's not a trap! Make this thing go away.

16:34.759 --> 16:36.750
Okay. I'll get the master.

16:39.797 --> 16:42.425
- Did you come alone?
- Yeah.

16:42.500 --> 16:44.934
Where'd you get that trench coat?

16:45.003 --> 16:48.234
- It's cool, huh?
- It's very cool. That was a smart buy.

16:48.306 --> 16:51.798
- All right, you got the tape?
- Affirmative.

16:51.876 --> 16:55.642
- Okay, what's this gonna take?
- You and Dennis gotta bow out of the race.

16:55.713 --> 16:57.613
- Not gonna happen.
- Gotta happen.

16:57.682 --> 17:00.150
Not gonna happen.
I want that tape.

17:00.218 --> 17:02.152
I'm gonna need you to beg.

17:02.220 --> 17:04.484
- Don't make me beg.
- You gotta beg.

17:04.556 --> 17:06.751
- Seriously?
- Seriously. Down. Down.

17:06.824 --> 17:08.815
All right. I know what
you're talkin' about.

17:10.061 --> 17:13.497
- What do you say?
- Please, can I have the tape now?

17:13.565 --> 17:17.501
- No.
- God! Come on, Frank. What's this gonna take?

17:21.606 --> 17:23.540
What the hell is that?

17:23.608 --> 17:26.509
Charlie traded me
his whole collection...

17:26.578 --> 17:28.603
of Garbage Pail Kids for the tape.

17:28.680 --> 17:31.615
Oh, my God. This is bad.
This is so bad, man.

17:31.683 --> 17:34.550
These things, Mac...
You don't know how rare they are.

17:34.619 --> 17:36.780
These are rare.
You can't find these.

17:36.854 --> 17:40.017
Bro, I am in some serious shit.
I needed him to drop out.

17:40.091 --> 17:43.788
I don't care what you need.
That is politics, bitch.

17:46.030 --> 17:47.964
I wanna tell you somethin'.

17:48.032 --> 17:50.330
- I'm really glad you asked me out.
- Me too.

17:50.401 --> 17:53.495
- How's that drink comin'?
- Strong.

17:53.571 --> 17:56.369
I should really probably think about
gettin' something to eat.

17:56.441 --> 17:58.204
Yeah. Still got a little left there.

17:58.276 --> 18:01.404
Not for long.

18:01.479 --> 18:03.709
Hey, have mine.

18:03.781 --> 18:06.409
Oh. You're such a gentleman.

18:06.484 --> 18:10.352
Are you gonna buy me
some food at some point? Or...

18:10.421 --> 18:13.083
What do you say we get outta here?

18:13.157 --> 18:15.387
- Oh.
- Who's the slut?

18:15.460 --> 18:18.258
- Honey, this isn't what...
- Another one of your whores?

18:18.329 --> 18:20.422
Who do you think you are... Bill Clinton?
You're a comptroller.

18:20.498 --> 18:22.090
Did he tell you he had a wife?

18:22.166 --> 18:24.691
- Did he tell you that, you goddamn whore?
- No.

18:24.769 --> 18:27.397
- Whoa! Whoa! All right.
- You bitch!

18:30.575 --> 18:33.271
Hey! Pour me a shot there,
buddy boy. I got it.

18:33.344 --> 18:35.335
- Oh, what'd you get?
- I got the smear tape.

18:35.413 --> 18:38.905
- Oh, hey, man. That's great.
- Yes!

18:38.983 --> 18:42.612
Whoa. Sweet Dee.
What the hell's goin' on with you?

18:42.687 --> 18:44.917
Screw politicians.
Charlie, pour me a shot.

18:44.989 --> 18:47.617
No time for that. We gotta get
back out on that campaign trail.

18:47.692 --> 18:50.923
- What do you say?
- Oh, yeah. Hey, man, I was doin' some thinking about that.

18:50.995 --> 18:54.897
- I don't wanna do that anymore.
- What?

18:54.966 --> 18:57.366
Oh, yeah. I googled "comptroller."

18:57.435 --> 19:00.199
Turns out that this guy's
really just a glorified accountant.

19:00.271 --> 19:03.707
You know what I mean? And I hate
doing math. It sounds like a ton of work.

19:03.775 --> 19:05.766
- You know what I'm sayin'? I hate work.
- No.

19:05.843 --> 19:08.505
These guys, they make
less than teachers. It's a...

19:08.579 --> 19:11.412
- So what?
- So I'm not doing it anymore.

19:11.482 --> 19:15.441
- No. You have to run.
- No, I don't.

19:15.520 --> 19:17.784
Yeah. Yeah, you do.

19:18.990 --> 19:20.981
- No, I don't.
- Yeah, you do.

19:21.059 --> 19:23.550
No, I don't.
You're not the boss of me.

19:23.628 --> 19:25.619
I'm the campaign manager.

19:25.697 --> 19:28.325
You're fired.

19:28.399 --> 19:31.664
I traded all my Garbage Pail Kids for you.

19:31.736 --> 19:34.569
Well, that was stupid.

19:49.620 --> 19:52.020
Bit of an overreaction,
don't you think?

19:52.090 --> 19:54.650
You look like a whore.

19:57.695 --> 20:00.425
- Psst. You come alone?
- Yeah.

20:00.498 --> 20:02.466
Why couldn't we just
meet in your apartment?

20:02.533 --> 20:04.501
- It's not safe.
- Is that Frank's trench coat?

20:04.569 --> 20:06.594
- Yeah. Pretty sweet, right?
- Totally sweet.

20:06.671 --> 20:08.605
Listen. I need your help.
I'm in a lot of shit.

20:08.673 --> 20:11.665
- I'm listening.
- I need to make Dennis disappear.

20:11.743 --> 20:14.109
Ah! Ah! That's what
I'm talkin' about.

20:14.178 --> 20:16.271
- Really?
- I was thinkin' that same thing, man.

20:16.347 --> 20:19.214
- That's great. I know you guys have become close.
- Not that close.

20:19.283 --> 20:21.217
How do you wanna do this thing?

20:21.285 --> 20:23.515
- If we use a gun, we're gonna need a silencer.
- A gun?

20:23.588 --> 20:26.352
Fine. No guns. Piano wire.
Maybe we can use some piano wire.

20:26.424 --> 20:28.358
Look, whatever it is...

20:28.426 --> 20:30.860
I gotta be the guy
to pull the trigger on this thing.

20:30.928 --> 20:33.897
Retard. I'm talking about
taking Dennis to Atlantic City...

20:33.965 --> 20:35.990
for a couple of days
until the election is over.

20:36.067 --> 20:38.968
What are you talkin' about?

20:39.036 --> 20:41.561
Atlantic City. That's good.

20:41.639 --> 20:43.539
Just take him down to the shore
for a couple days.

20:43.608 --> 20:46.304
- I'll take him to the shore. We'll go to Atlantic City.
- What's wrong with you?

20:46.377 --> 20:49.005
I give the guy my blood, sweat
and tears, right?

20:49.080 --> 20:51.310
And my Garbage Pail Kids.
And...

20:51.382 --> 20:53.714
And he just drops
right out of the race on me.

20:53.785 --> 20:55.776
- Dennis dropped out?
- He dropped right out of the race.

20:55.853 --> 20:58.344
So I'm out my Garbage Pail Kid...
And, like...

20:58.422 --> 21:02.381
If we used piano wire on him for a sec...
As long as we hurt him a little bit...

21:02.460 --> 21:04.257
Sorry, Charlie. Plan's off.

21:04.328 --> 21:06.319
- What are you doin'?
- I'm gonna go collect my money.

21:06.397 --> 21:08.831
Looks like you bitches
shouldn't have fired me in the first place.

21:08.900 --> 21:11.494
Are you kiddin' me?
Are you kiddin' me with that?

21:11.569 --> 21:15.027
I'm gonna buy myself a car. I am gonna drive
as far away from this goddamn city...

21:15.106 --> 21:17.233
Hey, Mac.
Where you runnin' to?

21:17.308 --> 21:18.900
Huh?

21:18.976 --> 21:22.377
Goin' to visit your friend
over at the union?

21:22.446 --> 21:24.971
What's goin' on?
Is there a problem?

21:25.049 --> 21:27.313
I don't know.
Phil, is there a problem?

21:27.385 --> 21:30.684
Conspiracy to solicit a bribe.
Racketeering.

21:30.755 --> 21:32.689
I'd say there's a big problem.

21:32.757 --> 21:35.487
Your buddy over at the union
came to see us recently.

21:35.560 --> 21:38.427
Told us about
your interest in politics.

21:38.496 --> 21:42.830
- He ratted you out, Mac.
- Apparently, you called him a nerd, Mac.

21:42.900 --> 21:45.061
Some people don't take kindly
to that type of insult.

21:45.136 --> 21:48.196
Yeah. You're goin' away
for a long time...

21:48.272 --> 21:50.968
and prison can be
a very unpleasant place...

21:51.042 --> 21:53.510
for a good-lookin'
young man like yourself.

21:53.578 --> 21:55.910
Oh, yeah. They're gonna
tear through you like Kleenex.

21:55.980 --> 21:57.914
That is, of course...

21:57.982 --> 22:01.440
unless you got something
to make it worth our while.

22:03.254 --> 22:05.245
Are you soliciting a bribe from me?

22:07.525 --> 22:10.016
Sorry, pal. That's politics.
